@startuml courtlistener_bulk
title courtlistener_bulk: judges + federal judges' disclosures
start
:list the public S3 bucket; pick the newest
people-db-people-<date>.csv.bz2 snapshot;
:download each table's .csv.bz2 (cached forever per snapshot)
and decompress to the cache;
note right
  Postgres CSV exports with backslash-escaped quotes:
  the reader is told escape='\' (sniffing lost rows and
  choked on the reimbursements file).
  Filtering to Missouri courts happens in dbt.
end note
:cl_people, cl_positions, cl_courts, ...,
cl_financial_disclosures, cl_fd_*;
stop
@enduml
